#: ../../resources_page.rst:210
msgid ""
"KanvasBuddy: a small dialog that floats on top of the canvas packed with "
"enough features to let you spend as much time in Canvas-Only mode as "
"possible. The idea behind KB was to provide the 20% of tools used 80% of the "
"time in the most out-of-the-way GUI possible."
msgstr ""
"KanvasBuddy: un petit diàleg que flota a la part superior del llenç ple de "
"prou funcions per a permetre passar el major temps possible en el mode Només "
"el llenç. La idea darrere de KB era proporcionar el 20% de les eines "
"utilitzades el 80% del temps en una IGU el més allunyada possible."

#: ../../resources_page.rst:213
msgid ""
"Source, main page and download link: https://github.com/Kapyia/KanvasBuddy"
msgstr ""
"Font, pàgina principal i enllaç de descàrrega: https://github.com/Kapyia/"
"KanvasBuddy"

